sequenceDiagram
  actor R as Reader
  participant FE as React (article/feed card)
  participant API as Express API
  participant DB as MongoDB

  R->>FE: like / bookmark / repost story
  FE->>API: POST /api/submissions/:id/interact { type }
  API->>DB: upsert Interaction (user, submission, type)
  DB-->>API: updated counts
  API-->>FE: 200 { counts }
  FE-->>R: optimistic UI update (Redux)

  R->>FE: comment on story
  FE->>API: POST /api/comments { submission, content, parent? }
  API->>DB: create Comment
  API-->>FE: 201 comment
  FE-->>R: comment appears in thread

  R->>FE: follow author
  FE->>API: POST /api/users/:id/follow
  API->>DB: push user↔author into following/followers
  API-->>FE: 200 — affects future in-network feed candidates
